      "title": "Qt: Escape HTML when setting ElidedLabel text",
      "message": "Qt: Escape HTML when setting ElidedLabel text\n\nElidedLabels use Qt's rich text internally, but we need to make sure the\ntext we're passed via setText() is plain.\n\nFixes #18774\n",
